r-focused hand (W1-W2-W3-W4) and a Dots-focused hand (B1-B2-B3-B4), while maintaining the F1 pair as a potential winning pair. Since B7 is far from my B1-B4 holdings and only 2 copies remain unshown, it has minimal value for completing melds.\n\nAnswer: Play B7"}
